# TILTSHOT: the CPU rivals are weak and random. Their rounds are made when a
# tournament starts: whatever the seed, the best of them finishes between
# 4 and 13 over par (never at par or under), the rest behind, and no CPU
# ever takes fewer than one stroke on a hole. Seven rivals in 1P, six in 2P.
game tiltshot
wait 30
# through the menus
seed 101
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 30
expect state == 4
expect cpu_count == 7
expect cpu_best >= 4
expect cpu_best <= 13
expect cpu_worst >= 4
expect cpu_low >= 1
seed 1
cheat hole 1
expect cpu_best >= 4
expect cpu_best <= 13
expect cpu_low >= 1
